OCGRAPH 1
DOMAIN gameplay
NAME CollapseTest
DESCRIPTION Collapse to Function fixture: GraphCollapseTest collapses c2, c3, mul, addn and st into a function and writes collapse_test.output.ocgraph; CollapseFunctionTests runs both graphs and compares their variables.

VAR total float 0
VAR last float 0

NODE tick OnTick 0 0
NODE gv GetVar 200 400 var=last
NODE c2 ConstFloat 0 100 value=2
NODE c3 ConstFloat 0 200 value=3
NODE mul Multiply 200 150
NODE addn Add 400 250
NODE st SetVar 600 0 var=total
NODE c10 ConstFloat 600 300 value=10
NODE add2 Add 800 250
NODE sl SetVar 1000 0 var=last

LINK c2.value mul.a
LINK c3.value mul.b
LINK mul.result addn.a
LINK gv.value addn.b
LINK addn.result st.value
LINK tick.exec st.exec
LINK st.then sl.exec
LINK addn.result add2.a
LINK c10.value add2.b
LINK add2.result sl.value

ENTRY tick OnTick
